  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/06/IMG_0739.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(23 fotos) La Quedada Taurina d&#39;Onda ha reunit la vesprada d&#39;aquest dissabte al voltant de 500 persones al Raval de Sant Josep, on &Aacute;ngel Torres ha fet un discurs a la porta dels corrals per a reivindicar el m&oacute;n dels bous, especialment el del carrer. Despr&eacute;s s&#39;ha fet un passeig per la volta del bou: pla&ccedil;a del Rei En Jaume, carrers de Sant Roc i de Sant Miquel, El Pla, Calatrava i novament al Raval.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/nadal.escrig/videos/10222272262256729/\" target=\"_blank\">Punxeu ac&iacute; per a veure el v&iacute;deo en directe al Facebook</a></p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0739.jpg\" alt=\"img_0739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0741.jpg\" alt=\"img_0741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0742.jpg\" alt=\"img_0742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0744.jpg\" alt=\"img_0744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0745.jpg\" alt=\"img_0745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0747.jpg\" alt=\"img_0747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img_0748.jpg\" alt=\"img_0748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quedadataurina/img